{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3704","title":"Xiaomi Expands AIoT Offerings with Seven New Devices for Smarter Living","desc":"Xiaomi today announced seven new products expanding its AIoT portfolio. These new devices are designed to simplify daily tasks, enhance personal health, and bring smarter solutions to the home. ","view_cnt":"12807","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1727318843","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/635_operatorx_operatorx_opx/26/09/2024/8583c2c9e18b361eb11f6b9c452742d7.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBerlin, GERMANY, September 26, 2024 \u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi, a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company, today announced seven new products expanding its AIoT portfolio: Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro, Xiaomi TV Max 100 2025¹, Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025¹, Xiaomi Buds 5, Xiaomi Smart Band 9, and an updated Xiaomi Watch 2. These new devices are designed to simplify daily tasks, enhance personal health, and bring smarter solutions to the home. As a part of its Human x Car x Home strategy, Xiaomi continues to deliver innovations which seamlessly integrate advanced technology into daily life, while being more accessible and practical for users around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi's new lineup of robot vacuums caters to different home cleaning needs. Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max offers expert cleaning with advanced features such as high-temp auto mop pad washing and rapid hot air drying, an extendable mop arm and anti-tangle hair-cutting brush, and a super powerful suction fan blower, making it ideal for users who prioritize deep cleaning and minimal maintenance. Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro focuses on powerful suction and intelligent features, including a precise obstacle avoidance system and smart carpet detection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, Xiaomi TV Max 100 2025 and Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025 deliver an exceptional home theater experience with ultra-large QLED displays, 4K UHD resolution, and 94% DCI-P3 (Typ.) color accuracy for vibrant visuals. With a 144Hz refresh rate and seamless playback, these TVs are perfect for movies, sports, and gaming.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs the human element of its Human x Car x Home strategy, Xiaomi also introduces Xiaomi Smart Band 9 for advanced fitness and daily wellness tracking, Xiaomi Buds 5 for immersive audio, and the updated Xiaomi Watch 2, offering seamless connectivity and sports training features.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max: Enhanced Power and Precision for Superior Home Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/954_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/ce405c1045232c2deb18f9bec167e2fd.png\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max offers a powerful and intelligent solution for a spotless home with minimal effort. Designed for those who prioritize both efficiency and effectiveness, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max features an upgraded all-in-one base station with a high-temperature auto mop pad washing system. Users can customize water temperatures for washing the mop, ensuring optimal cleaning results. Additionally, the hot air drying feature dries the mop pads in as little as three hours², preventing odors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA standout feature is the innovative extendable mop arm, which reaches into corners and along edges for meticulous cleaning. With an impressive 8000Pa suction power³, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max effortlessly lifts and removes deep-seated dust, pet hair, and other debris, making it an ideal choice for households with pets or allergies.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdvanced obstacle avoidance technology allows Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max to navigate seamlessly around furniture and other obstacles, minimizing the risk of collisions and ensuring a thorough clean every time. Powered by a robust 5200mAh⁴ battery, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max provides up to 120 minutes⁵ of continuous cleaning, making it perfect for large homes and multi-room sessions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro: Streamlined Cleaning for Busy Lives\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/557_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/99898a29faf06fc5282003f0a98192d4.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro offers a comprehensive and intelligent cleaning experience with its advanced features, ideal for busy professionals with large homes and apartments. The all-in-one base station simplifies maintenance by quickly auto-emptying its tank in just 13 seconds⁶, and automatically cleaning the mop pads, reducing the time and effort needed for upkeep.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a 7000Pa suction power⁷ and four adjustable suction levels, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro effectively handles dirt and pet hair on various surfaces, including carpets. Its smart carpet detection increases suction power where needed⁸, ensuring thorough cleaning. The vacuum's advanced obstacle avoidance technology navigates around furniture and obstacles, ensuring complete coverage of your home. Featuring a 5200mAh⁴ battery that delivers up to 160 minutes⁵ of continuous cleaning, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro is perfect for extensive cleaning sessions. Controlled via Mi Home/Xiaomi Home app, it offers a customizable and convenient cleaning experience that adapts to your home and lifestyle, making daily maintenance easier and more efficient.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi TV Max 100 2025 and Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025: Superior Smart Entertainment For Any Home\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/352_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/9d0b84400aa628ce7bb5474a6e384025.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi TV Max 100 2025 and Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025 offer unparalleled home theater experience with ultra-large QLED displays, 4K UHD resolution, and 94% DCI-P3 (Typ.) color accuracy for vibrant visuals. With a 144Hz refresh rate and seamless playback, they are perfect for movies, sports, and gaming. Dolby Vision® and Dolby Atmos®¹³ provide cinematic visuals and immersive sound, while Filmmaker Mode and HDMI 2.1 with VRR and AMD FreeSync™ Premium ensures smooth gaming and authentic film quality. AI-enhanced processing, a bezel-less design, Google TV™ integration¹⁴, and Xiaomi Watch 2 control make Xiaomi TV Max 100 2025 and Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025 the ultimate entertainment hub for any home.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Buds 5: Unmatched Sound and Comfort\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/186_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/ff25fcc2b01ba0ff82d8e8af142156e3.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 delivers flagship-level audio with 11mm dual-magnet driver, Harman AudioEFX tuning, Qualcomm® aptX™ Lossless and Hi-Res Audio certification⁹ for crisp, immersive sound. These lightweight earbuds feature advanced wide-frequency active noise cancellation with customizable modes and AI adaptive options, ensuring clarity in any environment. Designed for versatility, they offer crystal-clear calls even in 12m/s wind conditions with triple-mic¹⁰, built-in audio recording¹¹ ideal for content creators. With up to 39 hours of battery life¹² and smart force controls, Xiaomi Buds 5 blends premium designs with cutting-edge technology for an exceptional listening experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9: A Dynamic Fitness Tracker for Every Lifestyle\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/278_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/37e35f39f47c11a1faa897024c8981b7.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9 perfectly blends fashion and function, delivering superior performance for active lifestyles. Equipped with a powerful 233mAh battery that offers up to 21 days¹⁵ of typical use and features over 150 sports modes, Xiaomi Smart Band 9 is designed for fitness enthusiasts. Its enhanced health and sleep tracking features combined with stylish design and versatile accessories, make it a must-have for anyone looking to stay fit while making a fashion statement. Xiaomi Smart Band 9 also offers dynamic features such as linear motor for personalized vibrations and more than 200 band faces, allowing users to personalize their experience to suit various occasions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Watch 2: A Stylish Addition to Your Smartwatch Collection\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/679_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/09/2024/789b5f1ad1fd188c05bbf94202879807.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi is expanding its smartwatch lineup with an updated Xiaomi Watch 2, introducing a sleek Titan Gray color variant. Xiaomi Watch 2 now includes updated software and features to optimize the wearing experience in various scenarios, with these advancements set to extend to previous models. Among the new features are 10 fun watch faces, including the new Pet Park feature, which encourages users to stay active by rewarding steps to 'nurture' a virtual pet on your watch. Users can enjoy watching their pets grow and evolve across stages based on their daily activities. Additionally, Xiaomi Watch 2 offers the ability to control Xiaomi TV Max Series 2025 via remote function and access interactive boxing lessons through Mi Fitness App.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max, Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro, Xiaomi Buds 5, Xiaomi Smart Band 9, Xiaomi TV Max 100 2025, Xiaomi TV Max 85 2025, and the updated Xiaomi Watch 2 will be available for purchase through Xiaomi's official channels and authorized retailers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max: Priced starting at €649.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro: Priced starting at €499.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Buds 5: Priced starting at €99.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9: Priced starting at €39.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi TV Max 100 2025: Priced starting at €1999.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi TV Max 85 2025: Priced starting at €1299.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Watch 2: Priced starting at €169.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor more detailed information on these products and their features, please visit \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/\"\u003eXiaomi's official website\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Product name may vary by region.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² The drying temperature, drying time, drying rate, etc. are tested in an environment of 25°C and 55% RH. The result shows that the mop drying rate is above 99% after 3 hours of continuous drying. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on different voltages and using scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ The fan blower of Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Max generates up to 8000Pa of air pressure. Test condition of 8000Pa: Make sure the robot vacuum is fully charged. The suction of the fan blower was measured up to 8000Pa using a vacuum degree tester with a range of 0–20000Pa and an accuracy of 0.01kPa. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Suction power may vary in different test environments.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ 5200mAh is the battery's nominal capacity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ When set to Vacuuming and Mopping under Standard mode, and fully charged. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Empty effect will depend on the actual usage scenario.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ The fan blower of Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20 Pro generates up to 7000Pa of air pressure. Test condition of 7000Pa: Make sure the robot vacuum is fully charged. The suction of the fan blower was measured up to 7000Pa using a vacuum degree tester with a range of 0–20000Pa and an accuracy of 0.01kPa. Data comes from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Suction power may vary in different test environments.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Carpet Boost mode must be manually activated in Mi Home/Xiaomi Home app.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Qualcomm® aptX™ Lossless Audio and Qualcomm® aptX™ Adaptive Audio are supported on specific Xiaomi phone/tablet models equipped with certain SoCs from Qualcomm Technologies. Qualcomm, aptX, and Snapdragon are trademarks or registered trademarks of Qualcomm Incorporated. Snapdragon and Qualcomm branded products are products of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Wind noise cancellation test data provided by the National Institute of Metrology, China. Actual results may vary depending on usage.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Please download Xiaomi Earbuds app to enjoy this function. Recording without the other person's permission might be a criminal and civil offense. Recordings are not permitted for commercial use and should comply with local laws and regulations, including the privacy rights of individuals involved. Xiaomi will not be responsible for any violations of law resulting from your actions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² The battery level is 100%, the volume of the earbuds is adjusted to 50%, the Bluetooth encoding mode is AAC, and the ANC, dimensional audio features, and dual-device connection are all turned off. Battery life test carried out by the manufacturer, test data based on simulation of real-life scenarios. Actual results may vary depending on firmware updates, usage conditions, charging level, and environmental factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ Dolby, Dolby Atmos®, Dolby Vision®, and the double-D symbol are trademarks of Dolby Laboratories Licensing Corporation. Requires video content that supports Dolby Vision® and Dolby Atmos®.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Google TV is the name of this device's software experience and a trademark of Google LLC. Google TV is not available in certain areas. Please refer to the local product information for your market.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ Battery life data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on use and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2614","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1727357701"},"common":null}